*   "Acute or ongoing medical condition that, according to the Site" [Source: Prot_000Novartis.pdf, pp. 53-54]

Patients fulfilling any of these criteria are not eligible for inclusion in the study [Source: Prot_000Novartis.pdf, p. 89]. Only patients who meet all inclusion and none of the exclusion criteria at screening will be eligible to proceed to the baseline visit [Source: Prot_000Novartis.pdf, p. 71].

