  (660018, '72adfb70-baee-42ba-9dcd-86639519a3d0' , NULL, NULL, 'What happens in cycle 1, day 2?' , 'Cycle 1, Day 2 Visit Worksheet
Important Note
The provided Schedule of Events does not explicitly list a \'Cycle 1, Day 2\' visit. Procedures are scheduled based on \'Screen -1 or 0\', \'Baseline\', \'Daily until discharge\', or specific day numbers (e.g., Day 6, Day 15). Please verify the exact day column in the Schedule of Assessments table for the intended visit.
If \'Day 2\' falls under \'Daily until discharge\', please refer to the daily procedures below. If it corresponds to another defined visit, please select that visit\'s worksheet.
Daily Until Discharge Procedures (if applicable)
Administer Plasma (if scheduled for this day)
Perform Vital signs including SpO2
Collect Clinical data
Conduct Targeted medication review
Evaluate Targeted Adverse events (when they occur)
Record VAS Pain Score
Note: CRP, haematology, chemistry, kidney and liver tests are performed at clinician\'s discretion.
Additional Considerations
Review patient\'s current status and any new events/changes since last assessment
Document all procedures and observations in source documents
Address any patient queries or concerns' , 'unknown' , NULL, '[object Object]' , '2026-02-12 22:46:58'),
