  (30045, 240001, 'sample:a-phase-i-ii-o-p-a62w0' , 44, 'safety' , 'Safety Assessments Safety measures will include:' , 21, 21, 248, '4fa57cf52a6998620e0b7986fd30814aba794bb9b1b0474ed7dea8016dfef32d' , '• AEs (including imAEs and AESIs)
• Hematology, clinical chemistry, and liver function tests
• 12-Lead electrocardiograms
