  (30203, 240001, 'sample:a-phase-i-ii-o-p-a62w0' , 202, 'safety' , 'Safety will be assessed through AEs, laboratory data (eg, hematology, chemistry, and liver function tests),' , 70, 70, 66, 'bb06321d4570285379254f274a99f50a7d54e0911a93624c01d8108c7313675b' , 'ECGs, physical examinations, vital signs, weight, concomitant medications and procedures, and ECOG
