  (180066, 390001, 'building:a-randomized-ope-fi7ee' , 65, 'safety' , '7.1 Specification, timing and recording of safety parameters' , 27, 27, 109, '47cbfe993e925aafca009f36fd82e739b44e54a5ab9d3870cd709c7e01674cdd' , 'Section: 7.1 Specification, timing and recording of safety parameters (safety, p.27)

o Grade 4 adverse events (life-threathening or urgent intervenstion required)
o SAEs.
o Transfusion related reactions. Transfusion of plasma is procedure with a long-standing
experience. The only safety concern with convalescent plasma during acute hospital are
