Per Protocol Set (PPS): if warranted, patients from the FAS with major protocol deviations will be
excluded from the Per Protocol Set. The PPS will be reviewed and finalized in a blinded fashion prior to
database lock at a Blind Review Meeting, attended by the Principal Investigator, Study Statistician and other
