The main purpose of this amendment is to include a new treatment arm for mRNA-2416 in
combination with durvalumab. This includes new primary study objectives in Phase I to determine
the MTD/RDE for mRNA-2416 in combination with durvalumab and in Phase II to assess the' , '[object Object]' , '2026-02-10 23:32:07', '2026-02-10 23:32:07'),
