lizumab 200 mg intravenously once every 3 weeks (Q3W) + chemotherapy
• Arm B: Placebo intravenously Q3W + chemotherapy
Oxaliplatin + capecitabine or cisplatin + 5-FU regimens are used as the backbone chemotherapy. The
chemotherapy backbone regimen needs to be decided on an individual patient basis before
randomization. There is no switching between regimens throughout the entire course of the study.
Oxaliplatin +
Capecitabine
