tolerated in pretreated patients with advanced GC. Adverse events reported were consistent with
the overall safety profile observed in the BGB-A317_Study_001 Phase 1a/1b study, and were
generally of low severity, manageable and reversible. The preliminary safety profile and
antitumor activity support continued development of tislelizumab in patients with
advanced/metastatic GC.
