5. STUDY TREATMENT
5.1. Formulation, Packaging, and Handling
5.1.1. Tislelizumab and Placebo
5.1.1.1. Tislelizumab
Tislelizumab is a monoclonal antibody formulated for intravenous infusion in a single-use vial
(20R glass, United States Pharmacopeia [USP] Type I), containing a total of 100 mg of antibody
in 10 mL of isotonic solution. Tislelizumab has been aseptically filled in single-use vials with a
rubber stopper and capped by an aluminum flip-off seal cap.' , '[object Object]' , '2026-02-11 05:53:48', '2026-02-11 05:53:48'),
