and ad hoc reviews will be undertaken if there are other specific safety concerns. The study will not stop
enrolment awaiting these DSMB reviews, though the DSMB may recommend temporary or permanent
cessation of enrolment based on their safety reviews. There are no pre-specified statistical stopping rules.
Given the severity of illness in COVID-19, there are no pre-specified study stopping rules for safety. The
protocol team will review AE / SAE data on an ongoing basis. If there are a concerning number of
unexpected AEs, the DSMB will be asked to review safety data in an ad hoc meeting.
