competent regulatory or health authorities. As such eCRFs, source records and other Trial related
documentation (e.g. the Trial Master File, pharmacy records, etc.) must be kept current, complete and
accurate at all times.' , '[object Object]' , '2026-02-11 06:07:35', '2026-02-11 06:07:35'),
  (300901, 510004, 'building:a-randomized-ope-gpq9y' , 100, 'general' , '9.3 Monitoring' , 36, 37, 224, 'c68f90f16a141870346b7c6bfa4b8ea4dc133e34016b9990b65e559ebd223010' , 'Section: 9.3 Monitoring (general, pp.36-37)

