- Adverse event evaluation
- VAS Score: daily until discharge
Serious adverse events and adverse events grade IV will be collected when these are not outcomes of the
study. When study-related procedures impose an additional burden on the clinical care of patients, they
can be waived.
Visit at Day 6 (+/-2)
If feasible: Viral qPCR (Nasopharyngeal swab)
Blood for COVID-19 antibody titer testing and immunoparesis (optional)
Visit at Day 15 (+/-2), 30(+/-3) and 90 (+/-5)
