Pregnancy is considered an immediately reportable event (but not an AE), and the investigator will record
information concerning the pregnancy on the appropriate form and submit it to the Medical Monitor,
Moderna pharmacovigilance at drugsafety@modernatx.com, and contract research organization (CRO)
within 24 hours of learning of a patient’s pregnancy. Study drug administration will be stopped in any
female patient who becomes pregnant while participating in the study, and the patient will be followed to
