- 1: Demographics include age, sex, race, and ethnicity.
- 2: Prior cancer history includes (i) date of diagnosis, (ii) staging, (iii) all previous therapies (ie, chemotherapy, immunotherapy, biologic or targeted agents, experimental therapies, radiotherapy, and surgery), (iv) previous therapy details (ie, regimen, start and stop dates), and (v) best response for each regimen.
