(2) For potential participants that attend in person or contact their Primary Care team, the Investigator
or delegate is required to log into the REDCap system with their practice ID and password to initiate
the consent procedure. The participant will be asked to complete the ICF on their internet connected
device or a computer at the site. The Investigator or delegate(s) will then sign and date the ICF and
