  (390318, 570034, 'sample:preventing-strok-13m40' , 103, 'general' , '4.1 Timing & assessment of outcomes' , 30, 30, 74, 'dae7e04a17afb913e052ff888c21d716e8cbfa9f21e813618b8dfa7b9b80586e' , 'Section: 4.1 Timing & assessment of outcomes (general, p.30)

