If the dipstick result is positive for a combination of nitrite, leucocytes and/or blood and protein,
it is recommended that the sample is sent for bacteriological culture. Investigators may use
clinical judgement for this additional assessment.' , '[object Object]' , '2026-02-12 18:42:27', '2026-02-12 18:42:27'),
