will be listed by treatment group and patient.' , '[object Object]' , '2026-02-12 18:42:27', '2026-02-12 18:42:27'),
  (390910, 570036, 'sample:an-open-label-mu-f4vma' , 303, 'general' , '11.3 Treatments' , 144, 144, 31, 'f125a06569b2d8560ee800dcda629d0eda2023133fe0b78343598a715f41485e' , 'Section: 11.3 Treatments (general, p.144)

