  (390923, 570036, 'sample:an-open-label-mu-f4vma' , 316, 'dosing' , '11.5.5 Pharmacokinetic / Pharmacodynamic relationships' , 148, 148, 59, '7226320e16ee68302fccbbf0d51699713608fa622289b3989ee61849f054bfdf' , 'Section: 11.5.5 Pharmacokinetic / Pharmacodynamic relationships (dosing, p.148)

If possible and depending on the data a PK/PD model will be developed relating PK to SMN
