  (390926, 570036, 'sample:an-open-label-mu-f4vma' , 319, 'safety' , 'safety concerns.' , 149, 149, 46, '9c456460104b438e112c14f0d65643f7848a45efca434cee1c074bc5b7abb204' , 'Section: safety concerns. (safety, p.149)

