  (391016, 570037, 'sample:a-phase-3-open-l-rhrr4' , 45, 'general' , '4.2  Rationale for the Proposed Study' , 17, 18, 157, '77e56a062319e023ecb7887329b7d43f56eda276c7440ddba0583fe79eddb65a' , 'Section: 4.2  Rationale for the Proposed Study (general, pp.17-18)

After completion of the clinical studies for TAK-536 in subjects 6 to less than 16 years of age in
which blood pressure reduction effects of TAK-536 and no significant safety issues were
observed, this current study is planned to evaluate the safety, efficacy, and pharmacokinetics of
52-week administration of TAK-536 in pediatric patients with hypertension aged 2 to less than 6
years.
Before conducting this study, the sponsor had the consultation with the Pharmaceuticals and
Medical Devices Agency of Japan (PMDA) in June 2020.
