[Renal dysfunction-related AE]
Renal failure, acute renal failure, renal impairment, prerenal failure, acute prerenal failure,
anuria, oliguria, nephropathy toxic, acute phosphate nephropathy, and azotaemia.
[Hyperkalemia-related AE]
Blood potassium increased, Hyperkalaemia
