period must consent to pre-treatment and on-treatment tumor biopsies. For all patients, every attempt to
biopsy the same lesion pre- and post-dose should be made to minimize inter-lesion variability. If, for any
reason, a lesion that has been biopsied pre-dose is not amenable to intratumoral injection with study drug,
a different lesion or lesions may be injected, providing that the lesion can be biopsied post-dose.
For all biopsies of tumors that have received intratumoral injections, the biopsy site should be the same as,
or as close as possible to, the site of injection of mRNA-2416.
