mRNA-2416 will be supplied in 2 mL glass vials containing 2 mg/mL of mRNA. Each vial contains a 1.4
mL fill volume (2.8 mg mRNA).
Durvalumab will be supplied as a 500mg vial solution for infusion after dilution (50 mg/ml).
The study medication will be labeled according to the requirements of local law and legislation as well as
current Good Manufacturing Practice and GCP guidelines. Proof labels, detailing actual label text, will be
available in the study files of all participating countries.' , '[object Object]' , '2026-02-12 22:41:25', '2026-02-12 22:41:25'),
