Medical Oncology (ESMO) in 2017 (Desai et al 2017). As of 8 Jun 2017, 46 patients with
heavily pretreated GC have been enrolled in BGB-A317_Study_001 Phase 1a/1b totally. A total
of 34 GC patients were evaluable. Four patients achieved a confirmed PR, and 3 patients
achieved a best overall response of SD. The disease control rate (DCR) was 21%. Treatment-
related adverse events (TRAEs) occurred in 15 patients. Decreased appetite (n=4, 27%),
