*   "Added criteria for thyroid function, expansion lesion requirements, life expectancy and body weight." [Source: Prot_000 Moderna.pdf, pp. 4-80]
*   "Eligibility criteria regarding disease state and prior therapies for patients in Dose Confirmation and Phase II Expansion period added." [Source: Prot_000 Moderna.pdf, pp. 4-80]
*   "Criteria for visceral lesions added." [Source: Prot_000 Moderna.pdf, pp. 4-80]
*   "Criteria for TSH removed (Thyroid abnormalities from prior therapies still excluded per criteria 3)." [Source: Prot_000 Moderna.pdf, pp. 4-80]
*   "Modified the use a highly reliable method of birth control from the Screening visit through 12 weeks to 120 days after the last dose of study drug." [Source: Prot_000 Moderna.pdf, pp. 4-80]

Additional context regarding changes to inclusion criteria:
*   "Eligibility criteria regarding disease state and prior therapies for patients in Dose Confirmation and Phase II Expansion period added." [Source: Prot_000 Moderna.pdf, pp. 5-8]
*   "Criteria for visceral lesions added." [Source: Prot_000 Moderna.pdf, pp. 5-8]
*   "Criteria for TSH removed (Thyroid abnormalities from prior therapies still excluded per criteria 3)." [Source: Prot_000 Moderna.pdf, pp. 5-8]
*   "Modified the use a highly reliable method of birth control from the Screening visit through 12 weeks to 120 days after the last dose of study drug" [Source: Prot_000 Moderna.pdf, pp. 9-10]

The provided documents also contain sections titled "inclusion criteria:" on pages 10-12, but these sections describe administrative changes to the protocol rather than listing specific patient inclusion criteria. These changes include:
*   "Added end of treatment visit" [Source: Prot_000 Moderna.pdf, pp. 10-12]
*   "Clarified safety follow-up visit and added a 180-day safety follow-up visit" [Source: Prot_000 Moderna.pdf, pp. 10-12]
*   "Corrected disease progression follow-up visit – visits at 3 months and 6 months post EOT" [Source: Prot_000 Moderna.pdf, pp. 10-12]
*   "Streamlined footnotes" [Source: Prot_000 Moderna.pdf, pp. 10-12]
*   "Corrected “symptom-directed physical exam” C2-C6 to indicate C2 only" [Source: Prot_000 Moderna.pdf, pp. 10-12]
*   "Consolidated tumor assessment procedure to one line" [Source: Prot_000 Moderna.pdf, pp. 10-12]
*   "Removed “baseline” – baseline assessments are done pre-dose on C1D1 or during screening" [Source: Prot_000 Moderna.pdf, pp. 10-12]

Verbatim Evidence:
"Structured Eligibility Criteria
Inclusion Criteria:
- 1. Added criteria for thyroid function, expansion lesion requirements, life expectancy and body weight.
- 2. Eligibility criteria regarding disease state and prior therapies for patients in Dose Confirmation and Phase II Expansion period added.
- 3. Criteria for visceral lesions added.
- 4. Criteria for TSH removed (Thyroid abnormalities from prior therapies still excluded per criteria 3).
- 5. Modified the use a highly reliable method of birth control from the Screening visit through 12 weeks to 120 days after the last dose of study drug." [Source: Prot_000 Moderna.pdf, pp. 4-80]

"Section 9.1 Inclusion Criteria: Eligibility criteria regarding disease state and prior therapies for patients in Dose Confirmation and Phase II Expansion period added. Criteria for visceral lesions added. Criteria for TSH removed (Thyroid abnormalities from prior therapies still excluded per criteria 3)." [Source: Prot_000 Moderna.pdf, pp. 5-8]

"Section 2 Tabulated Protocol Summary, Section 9.1 Inclusion Criteria and Section 10.6.1 Instructions for Male Patients: Modified the use a highly reliable method of birth control from the Screening visit through 12 weeks to 120 days after the last dose of study drug" [Source: Prot_000 Moderna.pdf, pp. 9-10]

"Section: inclusion criteria: (eligibility, pp.10-12)
Added end of treatment visit" [Source: Prot_000 Moderna.pdf, pp. 10-12]

"Section: inclusion criteria: (eligibility, pp.10-12)
Clarified safety follow-up visit and added a 180-day safety follow-up visit" [Source: Prot_000 Moderna.pdf, pp. 10-12]

"Section: inclusion criteria: (eligibility, pp.10-12)
Corrected disease progression follow-up visit – visits at 3 months and 6 months post EOT" [Source: Prot_000 Moderna.pdf, pp. 10-12]

"Section: inclusion criteria: (eligibility, pp.10-12)
Streamlined footnotes" [Source: Prot_000 Moderna.pdf, pp. 10-12]

"Section: inclusion criteria: (eligibility, pp.10-12)
Corrected “symptom-directed physical exam” C2-C6 to indicate C2 only" [Source: Prot_000 Moderna.pdf, pp. 10-12]

"Section: inclusion criteria: (eligibility, pp.10-12)
Consolidated tumor assessment procedure to one line" [Source: Prot_000 Moderna.pdf, pp. 10-12]

"Section: inclusion criteria: (eligibility, pp.10-12)
Removed “baseline” – baseline assessments are done pre-dose on C1D1 or during screening" [Source: Prot_000 Moderna.pdf, pp. 10-12]

